  3.914122138526379*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0f1a4894-ffed-4219-9830-\
153eb22183dd"],

Cell["\<\
by the antisymmetry of flipping those final two indices or by recognizing that\
\>", "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.914122139730134*^9, 3.914122157724018*^9}, {
  3.914122206880741*^9, 
