Cell["\<\
then we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll do something slightly odd and note that earlier \
we defined our rotations such that\
\>", "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.916114555041898*^9, 3.916114562035898*^9}, {
  3.916114621233975*^9, 3.916114629798544*^9}, {3.916114725890669*^9, 
