Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Unified Expression", "Subsubsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.916789965805529*^9, 
  3.916789972746907*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"44748b72-50e0-4403-95a0-\
00020c002a78"],

Cell["\<\
Following the realization that the kinetic energy can be written as a \
two-term expression, we would like to see how simplified the Coriolis can be \
if we unify the no momentum, real momentum, and complex momentum parts\
\>", "ExpositoryText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9167899741015663`*^9, 
  3.916790029087268*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bc410af9-077c-495a-95e5-\
b2c67fe5b11e"],

Cell["\<\
For that we will copy all of the expressions down, and rearrange them into \
groups, starting with\
\>", "ExpositoryText",
